<title>UK: Bibby in stake talks with Barlow.</title>
<headline>Bibby in stake talks with Barlow.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>British diversified industrials and trading group J. Bibby &amp; Sons Plc said on Thursday it was holding talks with South Africa's Barlow Ltd which may lead to Barlow making an offer for the 21.1 percent of Bibby it does not already own.</p>
<p>The independent directors of Bibby have instructed Robert Fleming &amp; Co. Limited to advise them in connection with any offer, the companies said in a joint statement.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
